Definition of done

The update is complete only when:

* Combo Assist is available, enabled by default, and behaves exactly as described.
* Repeating an active attack does not cancel that attack.
* Repeating Attack 1 or Attack 2 during its own post-attack cooldown triggers the opposite move when valid.
* Deliberately requesting another legal move results in responsive, clean cancellation.
* Run never causes unintended move cancellation.
* Combat Assist works reliably immediately after another move.
* Running while attacking no longer disables or bypasses Combat Assist.
* Combo Assist, Combat Assist, and move cancellation cooperate predictably.
* Every controller attack row displays the appropriate fighter-specific artwork.
* Existing game mechanics and interfaces remain functional.
* Automated tests pass, including new regression tests covering these behaviors.

This is a precision gameplay update, not simply an animation-speed or cooldown change.

The final result should feel responsive and intelligent, but never unpredictable.

Prioritize correctness, deterministic behavior, and compatibility over quick fixes.

Before finishing, provide a concise report covering what changed, which files were modified, what bugs were identified and fixed, what tests passed, and any remaining limitations. Do not claim browser testing or bug reproduction unless it was actually performed.
